{"id":"vod_sn_39169","vodId":"39169","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"圣剑锻造师","name_cn":"圣剑锻造师","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/2c8f2c5f6edf0bc0956bad50dd835084.jpg"},"summary":"曾经，一场可怕而又残酷的战争使整个大陆满目疮痍生灵涂炭，这场战争亦使“恶魔契约”成为了禁忌的代名词，从此成为历史，被封印在了滚滚的时间洪流之中。一晃眼多年过去，人们终于迎来了和平年代，瑟希莉（藤村步 配音）作为旧日贵族，如今的自卫骑士团少女，守护着父亲留给她的古剑，寻找着将其再度锻造的契机。　　某日，瑟希莉在一场意外之中发现拥有强大魔力的“恶魔契约”重现世间，与此同时，一位名叫路克（冈本信彦 配音）的男子，则用他神秘的佩剑，轻易破解了这强大的力量，巧合的是，路克正在经营一间锻造店。想要锻造宝剑的少女，遇见了经营着锻造店的少年，当两人相遇，命运的车轮开始了转动。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/btX49MCjqG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hyDhE0HHrS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t2sPgqmtN81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NcifiVNNQV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DLSGt1f3Hp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HRVA4vTgCi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jrEcbcx43z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zj2EScSqgm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iNbgsYY5n41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ay60PhW1TN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ybvi1KR5X91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XwXZd2HFn51/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:49.525Z"}